<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="row"><view class="brand">农知行</view><text class="link" bindtap="logout">退出登录</text></view><view class="title">{{user.role==='regulator'?'辖区地块':'我的地块'}}</view><view class="muted">{{user.name}} · {{user.role==='regulator'?user.district:user.org}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="search">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{!allowed}}" class="card muted">当前账号没有地块查看权限，请使用种植户或监管员账号。</view><block wx:else=""><view class="stats"><view class="stat"><view class="muted">授权地块</view><view class="stat-value">{{total}}</view></view><view class="stat"><view class="muted">已载入演示样本</view><view class="stat-value">{{demoCount}}</view></view></view><input class="search" value="{{q}}" bindinput="searchInput" bindconfirm="search" confirm-type="search" placeholder="搜索地块名称"/><button bindtap="search" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查询地块</button><view style="height:24rpx"></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length && !busy}}" class="card empty">暂无地块，请在 PC 端建档后刷新。</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="card" bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="row"><view class="name">{{item.title}}</view><text class="badge {{item.demo?'demo':''}}">{{item.demo?'演示':'用户录入'}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="key">作物</text><text class="value">{{item.data.crop||'未登记'}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="key">状态</text><text class="value">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="row" style="margin-top:22rpx"><text class="muted">{{item.data.geometry?'已有边界':'查看定位与档案'}}</text><text class="link">查看档案 →</text></view></view><button wx:if="{{total > rows.length}}" bindtap="more" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">加载更多</button><view wx:if="{{busy && !rows.length}}" class="empty">正在读取地块…</view></block><view class="note">地图边界和定位仅供生产管理参考。边界绘制与文件导入在 PC 端完成。</view></view>
